WEBVTT

00:01:57.556 --> 00:02:01.996
wrote about the role of physicians
in his book "Of the Epidemics."

00:02:02.436 --> 00:02:05.396
He said, and I quote,

00:02:05.396 --> 00:02:08.956
"The physician must be able
to tell the antecedents,

00:02:08.996 --> 00:02:12.236
know the present and foretell the future.

00:02:12.876 --> 00:02:14.596
Must mitigate these things

00:02:14.636 --> 00:02:18.716
with two special objects in view
with regard to disease.

00:02:18.756 --> 00:02:21.476
Namely, to do good

00:02:21.476 --> 00:02:25.156
or to do no harm."

00:02:26.236 --> 00:02:28.116
The doctrine of "do no harm"

00:02:28.116 --> 00:02:30.276
forms the basis of the Hippocratic Oath,